
# PROJECT: CryptoPulse Intelligence
## Full-Stack Crypto Market Intelligence and Trading Signals SaaS

Act as a senior software architect, full-stack engineer, quantitative researcher, data engineer, cybersecurity engineer, and product designer.

Build a production-oriented, full-stack cryptocurrency intelligence platform called CryptoPulse Intelligence. The platform must combine crypto news, ETF flow analytics, centralized exchange (CEX) liquidity, derivatives data, technical analysis, AI-assisted market interpretation, and explainable trading signals.

This is a real application project, not just a landing page or static dashboard. Implement working database persistence, real API integrations, authentication, background jobs, subscription entitlements, analytics, tests, and deployment documentation.

Do not claim a feature is working until its implementation has been tested. When credentials or provider access are unavailable, provide a clearly labeled demo mode and an explicit setup path rather than inventing data.

==================================================
1. PRODUCT GOALS
==================================================

Build a platform with these objectives:

1. Provide a public cryptocurrency market dashboard.
2. Aggregate and categorize reputable crypto and macroeconomic news.
3. Track US spot Bitcoin and Ethereum ETF flows and fund-level data.
4. Monitor CEX order books, spreads, market depth and liquidity imbalances.
5. Analyze derivatives funding rates, open interest and liquidations.
6. Generate explainable LONG, SHORT and NEUTRAL signals.
7. Combine technical indicators, ETF flows, order-book liquidity, derivatives and AI-assisted news analysis.
8. Provide backtesting, paper trading, alerts and strategy analytics.
9. Offer premium subscriptions with server-enforced feature access.
10. Provide an admin panel for data sources, users, subscriptions, assets, signals and system health.

Initial asset coverage:
- Bitcoin (BTC)
- Ethereum (ETH)
- Solana (SOL)
- Configurable major altcoins, including XRP, BNB, DOGE, LINK and other liquid assets supported by selected providers.

Support configurable spot and perpetual-futures markets. Clearly identify the exchange, market type, quote currency and instrument symbol for each dataset.

The initial product is an analytics and research platform. Do not enable live order execution by default.

