- Structured logs and metrics.
- Historical backfills.
- Graceful degradation when providers fail.

Do not make the main dashboard wait for every provider. Return available data promptly and identify missing components.

Use separate freshness thresholds for prices, order books, derivatives, news and ETF data.

When required data is stale, disable affected signals rather than silently substituting old values.

